8. Overall Update

We have completed the development and initial positive testing of the dynamic training expiration notification enhancement in SailPoint IIQ TEST. The solution now discovers expiring training records dynamically and evaluates entitlement-level requiredCourse and revokeOnExpTraining configurations before determining notification eligibility.

The key achievement is that the scan-only task successfully identified one user with qualifying removable access after the TEST entitlement was configured, compared with zero before the assignment, while sending no emails.

The next focus is negative scenario validation, controlled email delivery testing, and final regression verification before considering deployment.
